8. Edit or accept corrections individually.
9. Compare the original and revised content.
10. Run the audit again.
11. Request human review when necessary.
12. Approve, reject, or block release based on actual findings.
13. Export an audit report with traceable evidence.

Every step must be connected to real application logic.

